/* ============================================================
   DATA-EVIDENCE.JS  -  generated from research sources, do not
   hand-edit casually.

   Firm-level research evidence: which source supports which field,
   what kind of source it is, and when Power Board checked it. This
   file exists so the site can say, per fact:

     "Here is what we know. Here is where it came from.
      Here is when we checked it."

   WHAT THE STATES MEAN (they describe data quality, nothing else):
     verified   the fact is stated by the firm itself (its own site,
                a regulatory filing, or a release the firm issued)
                and Power Board recorded the source and check date.
     reported   the fact comes from credible third-party reporting;
                the firm itself has not been the direct source.
     derived    computed by Power Board from data on the site (Power
                Personality, Power Capabilities, Power Score). Those
                features label their own confidence; nothing here
                overrides that.
     (absent)   no evidence on file. THE HONEST DEFAULT. A field with
                no entry renders no badge at all - absence of a claim,
                never a fake one. Most of the long-standing 401 firms
                are in this state because their research predates this
                system; the research queue exists to work that down.

   PROVENANCE THAT LIVES ELSEWHERE, DELIBERATELY NOT DUPLICATED:
     - partner sources:    sources[] on each entry in data-partners.js
     - roster freshness:   TEAM_SNAPSHOTS (dated live crawls of each
                           firm's own team page)
     - deals coverage:     DEAL_COVERAGE in data-deals.js
     - holding prices:     prices.json, refreshed each weekday by CI
   research-trust.js reads all of these at runtime.

   FIRM-SUBMITTED CLAIMS (Request / Claim flow): when an approved
   claim enters the dataset, its evidence entry must use
   type: "firm-submitted" and status "reported", NEVER "verified".
   Verified is reserved for facts Power Board itself checked against
   the stated source. Submission is not verification.

   FRESHNESS POLICY: expectations live in RT_FRESHNESS_POLICY in
   research-trust.js. checked dates here are research events - they
   are never bumped by renders, deploys, or unrelated edits.
   ============================================================ */

